---
// Find a job (#645, #651, #650, part of #275). Where local public employers and
// the two hospital systems post jobs, free resume and computer help, and short
// trainings. Paying for training and unemployment are separate pages that wait
// for David (high stakes). Left off until a person confirms them (#644):
// Monongalia County Schools and WVU job boards.
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import ResourceCard from '../components/ResourceCard.astro';
import { loadDir } from '../lib/content.mjs';
import { fixFormUrl } from '../lib/group-requests.mjs';
export const page = { door: "family", topic: "work", label: "Find a job", summary: "Where the city, county, state and hospitals post jobs, free resume and computer help, and short trainings" };
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
const all = loadDir('resources');
const r = (slug) => all.find((e) => e.slug === slug);
---
<Base title="Find a job in Morgantown: job boards and free resume help" description="Where the City of Morgantown, Monongalia County, the State of West Virginia, WVU Medicine and Mon Health post jobs, plus free resume, interview and computer help and short career trainings near Morgantown.">
  <h1>Find a job</h1>
  <p class="lede">Many local employers post jobs on their own websites. Here is where to look, and where to get free help with a resume, interviews or a computer.</p>

  <nav aria-label="On this page">
    <ul>
      <li><a href="#boards">Where local employers post jobs</a></li>
      <li><a href="#help">Free help with a resume, interviews or a computer</a></li>
      <li><a href="#train">Short trainings and apprenticeships</a></li>
    </ul>
  </nav>

  <p>Just lost a job? <a href={`${base}/life-events/lost-my-job/`}>I lost my job</a> lists what to do first, in order.</p>

  <h2 id="boards">Where local employers post jobs</h2>
  <p>Government jobs, from the city to the state:</p>
  {r('morgantown-city-jobs') && <ResourceCard r={r('morgantown-city-jobs')} />}
  {r('mon-county-commission-jobs') && <ResourceCard r={r('mon-county-commission-jobs')} />}
  {r('wv-state-government-jobs') && <ResourceCard r={r('wv-state-government-jobs')} />}
  <p>The two hospital systems in Morgantown, listed A to Z:</p>
  {r('mon-health-jobs') && <ResourceCard r={r('mon-health-jobs')} />}
  {r('wvu-medicine-jobs') && <ResourceCard r={r('wvu-medicine-jobs')} />}
  <p>WorkForce West Virginia lists jobs from many employers in one place, and its Morgantown office can help you search:</p>
  {r('workforce-wv-morgantown-office') && <ResourceCard r={r('workforce-wv-morgantown-office')} />}

  <h2 id="help">Free help with a resume, interviews or a computer</h2>
  {r('american-job-center-job-seeker-help') && <ResourceCard r={r('american-job-center-job-seeker-help')} />}
  {r('mympls-job-and-computer-help') && <ResourceCard r={r('mympls-job-and-computer-help')} showCost />}

  <h2 id="train">Short trainings and apprenticeships</h2>
  {r('pierpont-career-training') && <ResourceCard r={r('pierpont-career-training')} showCost />}
  {r('apprenticeships-wv') && <ResourceCard r={r('apprenticeships-wv')} showCost />}
  <p>More classes, help finishing high school, English lessons, and help if a record or recovery makes it hard to get hired: see <a href={`${base}/work-and-learning/`}>Work and learning</a>.</p>

  <p class="meta">Sources checked October 30, 2026. We list where employers post their own jobs. We do not list single job openings, and we do not place people in jobs. Not here yet: job boards for Monongalia County Schools and WVU, until we can read their pages. Something out of date? <a href={fixFormUrl({ page: Astro.url.pathname })}>Tell us</a>.</p>
</Base>
